{"id":"fcabe060a57a2a7b","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-convergence-special-cases.md","title":"Transitivity, Reflexivity, Symmetry and Euclideanness","display":"prop-convergence-special-cases — Transitivity, Reflexivity, Symmetry and Euclideanness","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-convergence-special-cases","aliases":["89-prop-convergence-special-cases"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"prop-convergence-special-cases — Transitivity, Reflexivity, Symmetry and Euclideanness","depends_on":["[[89-df-convergent-frame]]","[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","[[89-df-reflexive-frame]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-convergence-special-cases"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-convergence-special-cases</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-convergence-special-cases — Transitivity, Reflexivity, Symmetry and Euclideanness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e81fa800505e986\" href=\"?note=3e81fa800505e986\" title=\"89-df-convergent-frame\">89-df-convergent-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2645a0212ae48293\" href=\"?note=2645a0212ae48293\" title=\"89-df-reflexive-frame\">89-df-reflexive-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为 Kripke 框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conv}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conv}\\)</span> 使用关系幂；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Refl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Refl}\\)</span> 为既有框架谓词。</li>\n<li>对称性、欧性在结论内展开，避免未定义的框架算子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}special\\text{-}cases}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{0,2,1,0}(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Trans}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{0,0,1,0}(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Refl}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{0,1,0,1}(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in W\\;(xRy\\to yRx),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{1,1,0,1}(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\;((wRx\\land wRy)\\to yRx).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}special\\text{-}cases}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{0,2,1,0}(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Trans}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{0,0,1,0}(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Refl}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{0,1,0,1}(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in W\\;(xRy\\to yRx),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{1,1,0,1}(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\;((wRx\\land wRy)\\to yRx).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 90；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>展开零次关系幂。第一式要求每条二步路径压成一条边；第二式共同终点必须是原世界；第三式一条边的终点必须返回起点；第四式从同一世界可达的两个点之间必须有从第二个到第一个的边。欧性与通常 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRx\\land wRy\\to xRy\">\\(wRx\\land wRy\\to xRy\\)</span> 等价，因为全称变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 可交换。这正是原书 Theorem 4(a)–(d)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-convergent-frame","status":"resolved","id":"3e81fa800505e986","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-convergent-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflexive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"2645a0212ae48293","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflexive-frame]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conv}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Refl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}special\\text{-}cases}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{0,2,1,0}(F)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Trans}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{0,0,1,0}(F)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Refl}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{0,1,0,1}(F)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in W\\;(xRy\\to yRx),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{1,1,0,1}(F)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\;((wRx\\land wRy)\\to yRx).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"wRx\\land wRy\\to xRy","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false}],"bytes":1632,"backlinks":[{"id":"3c0f02193bdf6c63","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a5f677e465ed7833","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-510","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-prop-convergence-special-cases]]"}],"outgoing":["3e81fa800505e986","5c02ba5095698c09","2645a0212ae48293"]}